namespace UObjectToolTips

DreamPostProcessRenderElement {
    at    Source/DreamGUIExtensions/Public/Extensions/DreamPostProcessRenderElement.h#DreamPostProcessRenderElement
    src   "This component will grab post-process result image and display here.\nNOTE!!! This only valid when target PostProcess RenderType is set to RenderTarget and bUseFullSize is set to false.\nUV channel:\n            UV0: Rect UV from (0,0) to (1,1)\n            UV1: Check DreamCanvas"
    text  "此组件将获取后处理结果图像并在此处显示。\n注意！！！ 仅当目标后处理渲染类型设置为 RenderTarget 且 bUseFullSize 设置为 false 时有效。\nUV通道：\n            UV0：从 (0,0) 到 (1,1) 的矩形 UV\n            UV1：检查 DreamCanvas"
    state machine
}
